<!doctype html>
<html class="dark" lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"><meta content="dark" name="color-scheme"><meta content="Personal Gleam projects and commercial web and mobile engineering work." name="description"><title>Projects | dev_ing</title><link href="/static/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"><link as="font" crossorigin href="/static/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.woff2" rel="preload" type="font/woff2"></head><body class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-50"><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header sticky top-0 z-20 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur"><div class="site-header-inner"><a class="site-brand" href="/"><span class="text-orange-500">dev</span><span>_ing</span></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><ul class="site-nav-list" role="list"><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/">Home</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" class="nav-link nav-link-active text-orange-500 font-semibold" href="/projects">Projects</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/blog">Blog</a></li><li><a class="nav-link text-zinc-300 hover:text-orange-400" href="/resume">Resume</a></li></ul></nav></div></header><main class="site-main" id="main-content"><!-- lustre:fragment --><div class="bento-section-header mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">01 // PORTFOLIO</p><h1 class="bento-section-title text-zinc-50">Projects &amp; Commercial Work</h1><p class="bento-section-subtitle text-zinc-400">Personal Gleam open-source projects alongside commercial web and mobile engineering.</p></div><section aria-labelledby="personal-projects-heading"><h2 class="bento-subhead text-orange-500" id="personal-projects-heading">Personal Projects</h2><div class="bento-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bento-half md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-orange-500/40 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">PERSONAL // OPEN SOURCE</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Dev.Ing</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="project-header"><img alt class="project-icon" decoding="async" height="40" loading="lazy" src="/static/icons/dev-ing.webp" width="40"><p class="text-zinc-400">Personal developer portfolio and engineering journal evolving from a client-side Lustre SPA into a server-rendered multi-page Gleam, Wisp, and Mist application with hybrid static GitHub Pages export.</p></div><ul class="bento-list"><li>Pure Gleam multi-page architecture rendered server-side via Lustre</li><li>Dual runtime supporting a live Wisp + Mist server and static dist/ export</li><li>Strict Test-Driven Development with wisp/simulate and Birdie snapshots</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Gleam</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Lustre</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Wisp</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Jujutsu</span></li></ul><a class="bento-link" href="https://github.com/kazlim-code/dev-ing" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Visit Dev.Ing repository -&gt;</a></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bento-half md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-orange-500/40 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">PERSONAL // OPEN SOURCE</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Glelements</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="project-header"><img alt class="project-icon" decoding="async" height="40" loading="lazy" src="/static/icons/glelements.webp" width="40"><p class="text-zinc-400">Early Lustre UI component library proof-of-concept exploring reusable design tokens and black-and-orange styling in Gleam, whose lessons directly shaped dev_ing_website&#39;s theme-parameterized component primitives.</p></div><ul class="bento-list"><li>Established the signature black-and-orange design token palette</li><li>Tested declarative Lustre component composition patterns</li><li>Informs the in-repo theme.gleam and Bento component architecture</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Gleam</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Lustre</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">CSS3</span></li></ul><a class="bento-link" href="https://github.com/kazlim-code" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Visit Glelements repository -&gt;</a></div></article></div></section><section aria-labelledby="work-projects-heading" class="mt-10"><h2 class="bento-subhead text-orange-500" id="work-projects-heading">Commercial Experience</h2><div class="bento-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5"><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bento-half md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">WORK // COMMERCIAL</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Wyrd Technology</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="project-header"><img alt class="project-icon" decoding="async" height="40" loading="lazy" src="/static/icons/wyrd-technology-icon.webp" width="40"><p class="text-zinc-400">Cross-platform mobile and web engineering delivering production user workflows across iOS, Android, and modern web frontends.</p></div><ul class="bento-list"><li>Built Capacitor hybrid mobile features bridging Swift and Kotlin native plugins</li><li>Delivered responsive Vue and TypeScript interfaces backed by automated testing</li><li>Collaborated across iterative product releases and cross-platform builds</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Vue</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Capacitor</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Swift</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Kotlin</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="bento-card rounded-2xl border p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 bento-half md:col-span-1 bg-zinc-900 border-zinc-800 text-zinc-50"><p class="font-mono text-orange-500 bento-eyebrow">WORK // COMMERCIAL</p><h2 class="bento-card-title text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Grafa</h2><div class="bento-card-body flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="project-header"><img alt class="project-icon" decoding="async" height="40" loading="lazy" src="/static/icons/grafa-icon.webp" width="40"><p class="text-zinc-400">Full-stack engineering on data-rich financial media and analytics applications spanning web interfaces, API services, and cloud infrastructure.</p></div><ul class="bento-list"><li>Developed TypeScript and Nuxt web applications for high-density market insights</li><li>Integrated PostgreSQL data pipelines and AWS cloud services</li><li>Maintained design consistency and API reliability across fast-moving releases</li></ul><ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 list-none p-0 m-0" role="list"><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">TypeScript</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">Nuxt</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">PostgreSQL</span></li><li><span class="badge inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-400 border border-orange-500/40">AWS</span></li></ul></div></article></div></section><!-- /lustre:fragment --></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-footer-inner"><p class="m-0 text-zinc-400">Callum Ingley · Built with Gleam, Wisp, and Lustre</p><a class="bento-link" href="https://github.com/kazlim-code" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub (@kazlim-code)</a></div></footer></body></html>
